	"data": "ESP32 Sensor Collection — Room 2.0 Hardware Plan\n\nBuilding a fleet of ESP32-based sensor nodes for environmental monitoring, presence detection, physical triggers, and Room 2.0 integration. All data flows through ESPHome → Home Assistant → Room 2.0 AR anchors.\n\nStarter Kit — First Purchase (~$60-80)\n\nThe goal: get one of each sensor type, build the first multi-sensor node, and validate the full pipeline (ESP32 → ESPHome → HA → Room 2.0).\n\nCore Boards\n\n| Item | Est. Cost | Source | Purpose |…",
